{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>《香港小姐競選2026》今日進行首輪面試，往年都有不少佳麗會由家人陪同下前往參賽，今年亦不例外。其中一位參賽者今年帶同爸爸前往電視城，當佳麗進入TVB後，其爸爸接受傳媒訪問。爸爸除了詳細地介紹自己女兒之外，更表示自己是心理咨詢師，全力支持讀科大的優秀女兒參選，更指自己是深圳人，女兒則是香港人。這位爸爸的愛女心切，非常厲害，更向現場記者狂派心心，全日最搶鏡！</p><figure><img alt=\"呢位佳麗帶埋爸爸一同前往電視城。（葉志明攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260602/1138445600208326656392468.jpeg/63fLKj824UiA_hY86hnI3XH_JPWy76evA0KV-TVClfk\"/><figcaption>呢位佳麗帶埋爸爸一同前往電視城。（葉志明攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"厲害了我的爸！（葉志明攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260602/1138445565881749504375962.jpeg/xrKUqoVY0AHAm0AnhA4gRqWXfOBQ5nB2zMyJbfrMiW0\"/><figcaption>厲害了我的爸！（葉志明攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"好識擺pose。（葉志明攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260602/1138445597528035328952480.jpeg/kZ8MEVELScB-MMCU7Ow-RV22qxz9kLH-NBBP1QIQT9U\"/><figcaption>好識擺pose。（葉志明攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"爸爸好得意。（葉志明攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260602/1138445595028099072817523.jpeg/94eM-gclmKRq64LUblpp3SjL7405ycgp7qoxgdiqMYE\"/><figcaption>爸爸好得意。（葉志明攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"好有信心！（葉志明攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260602/1138445592469442560270135.jpeg/JBJz2Z9_inf28_c25wY3TU7RGDQtaCkLGnCXQixwl0I\"/><figcaption>好有信心！（葉志明攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"向記者狂派心心。（陳釗攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260602/1138445568528486400754329.jpeg/Q9YCk-hUhO3SBMusGYnQ3M2I1c-cJ-hbbVOKs1tTirM\"/><figcaption>向記者狂派心心。（陳釗攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-02T03:58:42.050903+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":270,"images":6,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}